{
  "name": "Sharing power",
  "icon": "tribalpower:lattice_conductor",
  "order": 40,
  "next": "keeping_totems",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": [
        "Machines only draw from generators within 8 blocks. Once your camp spreads out, you will want Pulse to travel.",
        "Draw a chalk line between two totems: right-click one with **Ritual Chalk**, then the other (up to 16 blocks apart). \"Lattice link sealed\" means it worked.",
        "A [Lattice Conductor](lattice_conductor) placed near those totems and near a generator will then pull Pulse from the generator and fill the totems, which hold 250 Pulse each. Stations near any linked totem can draw on it.",
        "Conductors also extend the zone by themselves. Place them within 8 of each other, and within 8 of the generator. A machine within 8 of any conductor on that line draws the Pulse the line can reach, totems or not. One craft makes four."
      ]
    },
